                                "sense_id": "74870ddd-4117-3c68-a465-471ab72aa60f",
                                "text": "Fuck that / I'd rather be the young sav on the track / Sellin' dope and pimpin' hoes / 'Cause I'm the mack"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5b68f958-dde1-4daf-868e-55a0783c0cd8",
                                "sense_id": "74870ddd-4117-3c68-a465-471ab72aa60f",
                                "text": "Couple of savs around us smoking on gas in Ghana / I get the bag the commas shawty attached she want it"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e29cd791-cc1a-4635-9834-a06679751ea4",
                                "sense_id": "74870ddd-4117-3c68-a465-471ab72aa60f",
