                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1d71390-7413-4a78-99dd-3c611c41870f",
                                "sense_id": "8f03ffef-7f93-37b8-a92b-baf984c3be48",
                                "text": "“Well, I don′t know what you′ll think. I′m only saying this to show what you′ve all done for me, but last Christmas dinner I had cold savs.”\nThere was silence and then Mervyn added with a break in his voice, “Saveloys.[…]”",
                                "translation": "“嗯，我不知道你们会怎么想。我这么说只是想表达你们为我所做的一切，但去年圣诞晚餐我吃的是冷掉的萨弗罗伊香肠。”\n一阵沉默后，默文声音哽咽地说道：“萨弗罗伊香肠。 […] ”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d284182e-75b0-4624-baf0-15711f75b768",
                                "sense_id": "8f03ffef-7f93-37b8-a92b-baf984c3be48",
                                "text": "‘Your turn today, Lil,’ he said. ‘Fish and chips for me. No, wait, I′ll have savs, faggots and pease pudding.’",
                                "translation": "“今天轮到你了，莉尔，”他说。“我要炸鱼薯条。不，等等，我要萨弗罗伊香肠、肉丸和豌豆布丁。”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "138ff619-d00c-40b0-a309-be7b145e8161",
                                "sense_id": "8f03ffef-7f93-37b8-a92b-baf984c3be48",
                                "text": "The menu of the average fish and chip shop will also offer[…]battered savs/Pluto pups (these are basically saveloy sausages with a fried batter on a stick, dipped in tomato ketchup) as well as a choice of homemade marinated pickles.",
                                "translation": "一般炸鱼薯条店的菜单上还会提供 […] 裹面糊的萨弗罗伊香肠/炸热狗（这基本上就是裹着炸面糊的萨弗罗伊香肠，插在棍子上，蘸番茄酱），以及各种自制腌菜。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
